// Multi Class is a model where there are multiple classes per prediction sent by a customer, each with its own prediction and actual score
// It differs from our score categorical models in that all the classes are sent, not just the predicted "winner class"
// Multi Class has two types: multi label and single label
// Single Label has one output / one prediction label (class with highest prediction score) and one actual label. However,
// all classes ("winners and losers") are sent to Arize. Use score categorical model is only the "winner" is to be sent.
// Multi Label can have multiple prediction labels and actual labels
// Multi Label prediction labels are determined by comparing threshold scores to prediction scores for each class
